  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:420px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-lightgray pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Speed Theft</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/19/Speed_Theft_by_Jay_Garrick_The_Flash_I_%28DC_Comics%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180704083158\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Speed Theft by Jay Garrick\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/19/Speed_Theft_by_Jay_Garrick_The_Flash_I_%28DC_Comics%29.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20180704083158\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/19/Speed_Theft_by_Jay_Garrick_The_Flash_I_%28DC_Comics%29.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20180704083158 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/19/Speed_Theft_by_Jay_Garrick_The_Flash_I_%28DC_Comics%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180704083158 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Speed Theft by Jay Garrick\" width=\"270\" height=\"134\" data-image-key=\"Speed_Theft_by_Jay_Garrick.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Speed Theft by Jay Garrick.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">As a Speed Force Conduit, Jay Garrick (DC Comics) can steal speed from others, even beings as powerful as Superman, to render them immobile.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Steal the motion/momentum.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The power to <b>steal the motion or momentum from objects or people to reduce their speed or even virtually stop them</b>. Opposite of <a href=\"/wiki/Speed_Sharing\" title=\"Speed Sharing\">Speed Sharing</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSpeed_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Momentum Absorption/Siphoning/Stealing/Theft</li>\n<li>Speed Absorption/Siphoning/Stealing</li>\n<li>Speed Force Absorption/Siphoning/Stealing/Theft</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSpeed_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can steal the motion or momentum from objects or people to reduce their speed and potentially stop them. This ability also allows the user to enhance their own movements by compounding the stolen kinetic energy with their own.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSpeed_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Acceleration_Defiance\" title=\"Acceleration Defiance\">Acceleration Defiance</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Capacitor\" title=\"Capacitor\">Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Speed\">Enhanced Speed</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Speed\">Supernatural Speed</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absolute Speed\">Absolute Speed</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Molecular_Deceleration\" title=\"Molecular Deceleration\">Molecular Deceleration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Paralysis_Inducement\" title=\"Paralysis Inducement\">Paralysis Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Speed_Cancellation\" title=\"Speed Cancellation\">Speed Cancellation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Speed_Storage\" title=\"Speed Storage\">Speed Storage</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSpeed_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Friction_Manipulation\" title=\"Friction Manipulation\">Friction Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Kinetic Energy Absorption\">Kinetic Energy Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSpeed_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be limited to how much speed/momentum one can absorb.</li>\n<li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li>Weak against <a href=\"/wiki/Speed_Cancellation\" title=\"Speed Cancellation\">Speed Cancellation</a>.</li>\n<li>User may harm themselves without <a href=\"/wiki/Acceleration_Immunity\" title=\"Acceleration Immunity\">Acceleration Immunity</a>.</li>\n<li>May not be able to control amount of speed given.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Immunity\" title=\"Assimilation Immunity\">Assimilation Immunity</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a> users are immune.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSpeed_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Speed Force Conducts (<i>Arrowverse</i>)\n<ul><li>August Heart/Godspeed</li>\n<li>The Flash (Earth-90)</li></ul></li>\n<li>Speedsters (<i>DC Comics</i>)\n<ul><li>Barry Allen</li>\n<li>Jay Garrick</li>\n<li>Savitar</li>\n<li>Wallace West</li>\n<li>Wally West</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mashle.fandom.com/wiki/Abyss_Razor\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:mashle:Abyss Razor\">Abyss Razor</a> (<i>Mashle: Muscles and Magic</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://nanatsu-no-taizai.fandom.com/wiki/Ban\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:nanatsu-no-taizai:Ban\">Ban</a> (<i>Nanatsu no Taizai/The Seven Deadly Sins</i>)</li>\n<li>Elysium (<i>Aldnoah.Zero</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSpeed_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://arrow.fandom.com/wiki/Speed_Force_transmitter\">Speed Force Transmitter</a> (<i>Arrowverse)</i></li>\n<li>Speed Force Gauntlet (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Battletide (<i>Forgotten Realms</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSpeed_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"920d8168c380cd00feb33fb468155361\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:197px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:197px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Elysium_-Aldnoah-Zero--jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:109px; width:195px; top:43px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Elysium_(Aldnoah.Zero).jpg\" title=\"Elysium (Aldn